MF-HSRM: license scope and third-party notices
=============================================

This repository contains the MF-HSRM model architecture and example RGB-IR
data pairs in multimodal_datasets/.

Third-party software
--------------------
Parts of mf_hsrm/ are derived from Apple CVNets/MobileViT components. The
Apple license reproduced below and the applicable notices in ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS
continue to govern their respective third-party material. The original
copyright notices, dates, license terms, and disclaimers are retained.

MF-HSRM contributions and example data
-------------------------------------
The upstream notices identify the third-party software and its rights holders;
they do not attribute the original MF-HSRM contributions or the example data
to Apple or to the other upstream authors. This release does not specify a
separate license for the original MF-HSRM contributions or for the example
data in multimodal_datasets/.

This scope note does not modify, replace, or restrict any rights granted
under the applicable upstream licenses.

